{"id":1476170,"shortDescription":"Godstrike es un twin-stick shooter basado en el tiempo donde debes enfrentarte a despiadados bosses en intensos 1v1. Juega como Talaal, la última Heraldo, perseguida por su hermano. El tiempo es tu moneda y tu vida, ¡úsala para crear combos de habilidades y lucha por la gloria en los highscores!","developers":["OverPowered Team"],"publishers":["indie.io"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Tablas de clasificación de Steam","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"15 ABR 2021","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795243682","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_e013989164610efe87aec679287b574b841eb337.600x338.jpg?t=1795243682","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_e013989164610efe87aec679287b574b841eb337.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795243682"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_50753aa1c621ebe6df455fa316820a03dd3aff6f.600x338.jpg?t=1795243682","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_50753aa1c621ebe6df455fa316820a03dd3aff6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795243682"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_a26d03488cbb9cb4978789d48c0734d9b0cde186.600x338.jpg?t=1795243682","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_a26d03488cbb9cb4978789d48c0734d9b0cde186.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795243682"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_fddff2867100c2108c570cabdf3c8a465b329862.600x338.jpg?t=1795243682","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476170/ss_fddff2867100c2108c570cabdf3c8a465b329862.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795243682"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/